      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Total money = ₹1200\nTotal quantity = 30 kg\nAverage cost = 1200 ÷ 30 = ₹40/kg\n\nThe simple mean ₹45 is wrong because the cheaper price bought more kilograms.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
