      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let fixed cost be F and variable cost per boarder be v.\n\nF + 20v = 10000\nF + 40v = 16000\n\nSubtract: 20v = 6000 → v = 300\nThen F = 4000.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
